     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Folks,<div><br></div><div>Hope everyone is going to take a well-deserved break over the next few days. No work session this week, but next week a few things to take note of if you are interested in maps/spatial R. I&#39;m giving a few presentations:</div><div><ul><li><b>Monday 11/27 2-4pm:</b><i> <u>(</u></i><i><u>#Maptime)</u></i> Mapmaking in R tutorial<b> in Shields 360 (DSI). </b>We&#39;ll screencast the event on youtube, link is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pYeopQFtlIQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DpYeopQFtlIQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466648778000&amp;usg=AOvVaw224HFLuL5Wg9HTXXCqjjMB\">here</a>.</li></ul><ul><li><b>Thursday 11/30 10-12pm: (</b><u><i>D-RUG)</i></u><i style=\"font-weight:bold\"> </i>I&#39;ll be giving a short presentation on using the <b><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">sf </font></b>package for spatial analysis, same place (DSI 360). <b> </b>We&#39;ll screencast that as well. </li></ul><div>I&#39;ll do my best to make presentations different/complementary so I&#39;m not covering all the same stuff...but I&#39;ll likely cover a bit of <b>sf </b>in the #Maptime presentation as well.</div><div><br></div><div>Also, please remember to <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/hjDy5zQpdq77GqXf1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/hjDy5zQpdq77GqXf1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466648778000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tdGC_UTB7ukYSoyCLtZVa\">vote on a time/day for our worksessions</a> next quarter. At the moment, Monday 10-12 and Wed 12-2 are the leading session times.</div><div><br></div><div>Until next week,</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>R</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;tex